// Windows: member added to the local Administrators group
// MITRE ATT&CK: Privilege Escalation / Persistence - T1098 Account Manipulation
// S-1-5-32-544 is the well-known SID of the built-in Administrators group,
// so the rule still works if the group is renamed or Windows isn't in English.
// Triage: who was added (MemberSid), by whom (AddedBy), was it approved?
SecurityEvent
| where EventID == 4732
| where TargetSid == "S-1-5-32-544"
| project TimeGenerated, Computer,
          Group     = TargetAccount,
          MemberSid,
          AddedBy   = SubjectAccount
